*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0009.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY LON0009C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 MI-REQUIRED        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 RATE-ADJ           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM MORTGAGE-INS-CHECK
    DISPLAY "MI-REQUIRED=" MI-REQUIRED
    DISPLAY "RATE-ADJ=" RATE-ADJ
    STOP RUN.
MORTGAGE-INS-CHECK.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIREMENT
    IF LTV-RATIO GREATER THAN 85
        MOVE 'Y' TO MI-REQUIRED
        MOVE 0.0050 TO RATE-ADJ
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MI-REQUIRED
    END-IF.
